        maxPowerStockInternals: "300+ hp (The iron block and forged internals of the M111 are famously overbuilt. The bottom end can handle massive boost. However, tuning the Bosch HFM on a naturally aspirated engine yields almost no gains. Adding forced induction requires a standalone ECU, making it financially unviable for a 1.8L.)",
