        engineLifespan: "400,000 - 500,000+ km (The M112 is widely considered one of the most reliable V6 engines Mercedes-Benz ever manufactured. The aluminum block with silicon-aluminum (Silitec) cylinder liners is incredibly wear-resistant. The engine will easily outlast the W202 chassis; the true enemies of this vehicle are the catastrophic structural rust problems of the late 90s C-Class and minor, but annoying, oil leaks.)",
