        maxPowerStockInternals: "500+ hp (The internal rotating assembly is vastly overbuilt. The forged steel crankshaft and robust rods can handle significant power increases. The most common high-horsepower upgrade is retrofitting an Eaton supercharger from the later M113K engines, which the stock bottom end handles beautifully.)",
