          "Air Leaks (Fuel System Immobile): Even a tiny air leak in the clear plastic fuel lines will cause the Lucas pump to lose prime entirely, leaving the driver completely stranded.",
          "Snapped Glow Plugs: Removing a seized glow plug incorrectly will destroy the cylinder head threads, requiring engine disassembly to repair.",
          "Runaway Engine (Oil Ingestion): If the engine is severely overfilled with oil, the diesel engine can consume its own oil through the PCV, revving uncontrollably to destruction.",
