          "722.6 Automatic Transmission 13-Pin Connector Leak: The 5-speed electronic transmission frequently leaks ATF from the 13-pin pilot bushing, which wicks up into the TCM.",
          "Glow Plug Seizure: The glow plugs frequently seize in the aluminum cylinder head. Attempting to force them out snaps the plug, requiring expensive machine work to extract."
