      "Valve Cover Oil Leaks: The M112 is notorious for weeping oil from the main valve cover gaskets and breather chambers, dropping oil directly onto the exhaust.",
      "Rear SAM Water Intrusion: The rear Signal Acquisition Module located in the trunk is highly vulnerable to water damage from failing seals.",
