    oilSpecification: "8.5L 5W-40 or 0W-40 Synthetic (MB 229.5 strictly required. Frequent 5 000 km oil changes are absolutely critical to protect the fragile camshaft lobes. The engine consumes up to 1L of oil per 1 000 km by design; checking the dipstick weekly is mandatory.)",
