      "DPF Clogging & Regeneration Failure: The factory DPF becomes clogged with ash over high mileages. If the vehicle is only driven in the city, the ECU will refuse to regenerate the filter, forcing Limp Mode.",
      "EGR Valve & Intake Clogging: The electronically actuated EGR valve constantly pumps soot back into the intake. The soot mixes with PCV oil vapor, creating a thick sludge that chokes the engine.",
      "Electronic Steering Lock (ESL/ELV) Failure: THE defining flaw of the W204. The tiny electric motor inside the steering column lock burns out, completely immobilizing the vehicle.",
      "7G-Tronic (722.9) Conductor Plate: The 7-speed transmission frequently suffers from speed sensor failures on the internal conductor plate."
