      "Immobilization (ESL/ELV Failure): A burnt-out steering lock motor will leave you completely stranded without warning. Requires an aftermarket emulator to fix permanently.",
      "DPF / Exhaust Choking: A clogged EGR valve or failed exhaust sensors will prevent the engine from initiating a DPF regeneration cycle, causing the exhaust to plug up entirely.",
      "Transmission Limp Mode (Conductor Plate): A failed speed sensor in the 7G-Tronic transmission requires dropping the valve body and sending the conductor plate out for highly specialized reprogramming."
