      "Catastrophic Engine Damage (VVT Failure): If the cold start rattle is ignored for tens of thousands of kilometers, the camshaft adjusters can disintegrate and destroy the timing chain system.",
      "Overheating (Water Pump/Thermostat): Sudden failure of the complex water pump or the electronic thermostat will cause the aluminum block to overheat rapidly and potentially warp the cylinder head.",
      "Economic Total Loss (Turbocharger Actuator): The electronic wastegate actuator on the turbocharger can fail due to extreme heat. Mercedes often mandates replacing the entire turbocharger assembly rather than just the actuator, costing thousands.",
