      blockDesign: "The M264 represents a significant evolution over the M274. It is an all-aluminum, open-deck engine block with cast-iron cylinder liners. It features CONICSHAPE cylinder honing (the lower end of the cylinder is wider than the top) to dramatically reduce piston friction. After complaints about the 1.5L version lacking torque, Mercedes quietly reinstated this detuned 2.0L variant for the C 200 in late 2020.",
