      "Water Pump & Thermostat Failure: The M274 water pump features a vacuum-controlled plastic shroud designed to block coolant flow for faster warm-up. This shroud jams, causing rapid overheating and coolant leaks.",
      "GPF / OPF Sensor Failures: Facelift models feature a Gasoline Particulate Filter. The differential pressure sensors frequently fail, triggering Check Engine lights and Limp Mode."
