      blockDesign: "The M274 features a state-of-the-art all-aluminum, open-deck engine block with cast-iron cylinder liners. It utilizes a longitudinal layout and was engineered for rapid thermal management. However, in this PHEV application, the engine is subjected to incredibly harsh thermal shock, frequently being commanded to deliver full boost while the block is still completely cold.",
