    timingType: "Chain (Located at the REAR of the engine block. The OM654 utilizes a highly robust timing chain system located at the gearbox side. While significantly more durable than the older OM651, because the chain is located at the absolute rear, any required timing service involves complete engine or transmission removal. Frequent, high-quality oil changes are strictly required to maintain chain tensioner health.)",
    injectionType: "Common Rail Direct Injection / Bosch EDC17 (A state-of-the-art, 4th generation common-rail diesel injection system operating at up to 2 050 bar. It utilizes extremely precise solenoid injectors. To meet the ultra-strict Euro 6d-TEMP regulations, the exhaust is fitted with a highly complex aftertreatment system: a close-coupled Diesel Oxidation Catalyst (DOC), a Diesel Particulate Filter with SCR coating (sDPF), an SCR catalyst, and an AdBlue injection system. This system is incredibly sensitive and prone to sensor failures.)",
    engineLifespan: "300 000 - 500 000+ km (The all-aluminum 2.0L OM654 block with NANOSLIDE cylinder wall coating is a legendary piece of diesel engineering. The core engine block is virtually indestructible, especially in this massively detuned 150hp variant. However, its lifespan in the W205 chassis is entirely dictated by the extreme complexity of its emissions systems. If driven exclusively in the city, the DPF and EGR will permanently clog, and the AdBlue system will fail, immobilizing the car. If driven strictly on the highway, it will easily surpass half a million kilometers.)",
    turboType: "Turbocharged (Equipped with an advanced, fast-spooling Variable Geometry Turbocharger (VGT). The variable vanes adjust exhaust flow to eliminate turbo lag, delivering 360 Nm of torque incredibly early. Because this 2.0L variant is heavily software-restricted to just 150 horsepower, the turbocharger operates incredibly far below its thermal and mechanical limits, ensuring extreme longevity.)",
    ecuType: "Bosch EDC17 (A highly sophisticated electronic diesel control module that manages the 2050 bar injection, VGT turbo, and the incredibly complex multi-stage AdBlue and DPF regeneration cycles. Because this 2.0L block is mechanically identical to the 194hp C 220 d and 245hp C 300 d, the 150hp mapping is entirely artificial. Tuning potential is absolutely staggering via the OBD-II port.)",
    euroStandard: "Euro 6d-TEMP (Equipped with DPF, SCR, and AdBlue)",
    maxPowerStockInternals: "250+ hp (The internal rotating assembly of the 2.0L OM654 is vastly overbuilt. Because it is artificially restricted to 150hp, the stock internals experience absolutely zero mechanical stress. A simple Stage 1 software flash safely pushes the engine well past 220 horsepower, completely transforming the car into an absolute highway missile without stressing the bottom end.)",
