      { label: "Front Lower Control Arms", x: -0.22, y: -0.11, z: 0.46, critical: false, details: "MAINTENANCE POINT: The W205 front suspension is notorious for severe creaking and groaning over speed bumps due to failing lower control arm bushings." }
