    maxPowerStockInternals: "260+ hp (The internal rotating assembly of the downsized 1.5-liter M254 is incredibly robust, sharing massive architectural similarities with the larger 2.0L variant. Because it is artificially restricted to 170hp, the stock internals experience absolutely zero mechanical stress. The true limitation for power is the flow capacity of the 1.5L turbocharger and the strict thermal limits of the GPF exhaust filter.)",
