    injectionType: "Common Rail Direct Injection / Bosch MD1 (A state-of-the-art, 4th generation common-rail diesel injection system operating at up to 2 500 bar in the OM654M. To meet Euro 6d-ISC-FCM regulations, it features an incredibly complex dual-dosing SCR system: two SCR catalytic converters and twin AdBlue injectors, alongside a close-coupled DPF. Highly sensitive to fuel quality.)",
    engineLifespan: "250 000 - 400 000+ km (The all-aluminum 2.0L OM654M block with NANOSLIDE cylinder wall coating is a masterpiece of diesel engineering. Mechanically, the core engine is virtually indestructible. However, its lifespan in the W206 chassis is entirely dictated by the 48V ISG system and the dual-SCR emissions setup. If the transmission-mounted ISG or the complex AdBlue system fails, the repair costs are astronomical.)",
