    ecuType: "Bosch MD1 (A highly sophisticated electronic diesel control module that manages the massive 2500 bar injection, VGT turbo, the 48V Gen-2 ISG torque fill, and the incredibly complex twin-dosing AdBlue regeneration cycles. This specific ECO variant uses incredibly optimized mapping for fuel efficiency, but tuning potential remains phenomenal via the OBD-II port.)",
